#!/usr/bin/env python3
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""
Mailbox Scribe.

Purpose:
- Generate a single, up-to-date session packet markdown from mailbox artifacts.
- Update mailbox manifest/current-state files without deleting history.

